<title>GERMANY: W.German prelim Oct CPI inflation 1.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>W.German prelim Oct CPI inflation 1.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PRELIM W.GERMAN INFLATION    Oct 96	  Sept 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)   unch	     -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)	   +1.5	     +1.4</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		  n/a	    114.4</p>
<p>Note - The new figure is provisional. The Office will publish final figures in about 10 days.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
